## Naming Relationship

The planning documents often call this work Stage I because it implements the
DC approximation / AC projection comparison. The implemented package directory
is `stage_i_dc_comparison`, while the primary runner and result root use Stage H
naming:

```text
run_stage_h_dc_comparison.py
results/leq/stage_h/DC Approximation + Baseline Heuristic Comparison/
```

This package records the naming relationship as evidence and does not assume the
names are interchangeable beyond the documented implementation history.

